{
  "kind": "native-tesseract-public-card-characterization",
  "engine": "tesseract 5.3.4",
  "limitations": [
    "Two public catalogue scans and one public retailer photograph; not the owner's physical phone camera.",
    "Native Tesseract and Pillow approximate preprocessing; not browser Tesseract.js/WASM or end-to-end app testing.",
    "Four deterministic image variants per game plus a manually cropped YGO control; not a representative accuracy estimate.",
    "Production geometry/parser/evidence are exercised; candidate catalogue completeness, provider lookup, auto capture and collection saving are outside this runner.",
    "These are fixed-band experiments, not a replay of the app fallback sequence. For rejected geometry the app starts with original-image recovery; direct band results here are diagnostic only.",
    "Full-card OCR is recorded separately; no failed band is selectively replaced when calculating band evidence."
